// Shell or WMIC Connecting to a Remote Administration Port
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_remote_admin_port_from_shell.yml (225fb315-6b98-4dc9-aca4-a548bdc8f8cf)
// Level: medium. ATT&CK: T1021.002 SMB/Windows Admin Shares, T1021.006 Windows Remote Management
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where (event.provider:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon" and event.code:"3") and ((process.executable like~ ("*\\cmd.exe", "*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe", "*\\wmic.exe")) and (destination.port like~ ("445", "135", "5985", "5986")))
